        "id": 3948337
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-28T19:30:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This *does* need to get zeroed, because the previous zeroing only occurred up the alignment of the *previous* reservation count. In this case where `fReservedCount \u003e\u003d alignedCount` we are now overwriting that padding and appending more data; that appended data needs its padding too.",
      "parentUuid": "1524edcc_561bccf3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 338,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 340,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "3506a82ddd35d9fce353d2feb113bfdaa8053915",
