        "id": 3948337
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-28T21:16:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes; that is handled in the `zeroBytes()` call below, which occurs after `returnBytes`. Regardless of whether we got a new buffer, or a writer that\u0027s on the same buffer, we zero out the tail. Because we got the writer after `returnBytes`, we know its looking at the right place.",
